1. User uploads DXF → scenario auto-detected → layer sequence initialized to default
2. Navbar shows: `Sequence [FREZ ▼] → [CUT ▼]` with colored labels and T-numbers
3. User clicks [CUT ▼] dropdown → selects "1." → CUT moves to first position
   → sequence becomes `CUT → FREZ` → regeneration triggered automatically
4. Navbar now shows: `Sequence [CUT ▼] → [FREZ ▼]` with amber "custom" badge
5. Settings dialog shows same layers with ↑↓ buttons for reordering
6. "Reset Order" button in settings restores scenario default
